WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.338
Tachikoma, cover Ishikawa!

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:06.506
Batou!

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.054
That's more like it!

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:17.225
Time for some war gaming!

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:31.156
Ishikawa, the one on the right.

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:33.533
No, your other right!

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.785
They're screwing with me.

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:43.043
-What was that?
-You're a lousy shot.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:46.379
-Boo!
-Shut up, you two!

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:52.927
C'mon, Mr. Ishikawa, let us deploy too!

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:55.722
Can't right now! Sit tight!

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:04.939
Tachikoma, do it!

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:06.191
Roger.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:02.330
You got your role here down pat.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.904
Hey, dumbasses!

00:02:36.072 --> 00:02:38.950
Learn to shoot straight
before you join a gun battle.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:42.662
Hey, wasn't I amazing?

00:02:44.581 --> 00:02:46.374
Yeah, you did pretty good.

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:49.669
Then how about petting me?

00:02:50.253 --> 00:02:51.546
All right, fine.

00:02:53.756 --> 00:02:55.675
Die, you one-percenter lapdog!

00:02:56.801 --> 00:02:57.677
Huh?

